  "display_title": "Third Ending",
  "description": "Seo Yun-Seul has had life easy—everyone likes him, he’s good at his job, basically, everything has always worked out as smooth as butter. However, there’s something that brings all of his good luck down, and it’s the infrequent dreams he has of Kang Jun. Who knew that rejecting a guy once would hang so heavy on your life? To make things worse, after he runs into Jun the dreams keep on coming daily. At his wit’s end, Yun-Seul takes some advice from a friend so that he can free himself from this jinx. It’s simple. Make Kang Jun think that he’s a nice person. That can’t be hard, right? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US, edited) \n\n*Note:\n\\- From season 2 (chapter 36) this becomes Mature (R19), Season 1 is All-Ages (R15).\n\\- Includes nine extra chapters.*",
